    "Content": "<p>Azure Functions now supports developing and editing applications, running on Linux,&nbsp;to be created and edited within the Azure portal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about developing Functions in the portal: <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/functions-create-function-app-portal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">C</a><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/functions-create-function-app-portal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">reate your first function in the Azure portal</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Functions now supports developing and editing applications, running on Linux, to be created and edited within the Azure portal.\n\nLearn more about developing Functions in the portal: C reate your first function in the Azure portal ."
